``` Behaviour 1 (Alert): App sign-ins from outside the MSP Process address
    Look for: Service principal sign-ins for the app connected to MSP Process from any address other than 64.236.54.139, from 09:56 UTC on 7 November 2026
    Log source: Entra service principal sign-in logs, in the MSP's own tenant where the app is registered
    Lead, not proof: compare any hit with your own baseline before acting. ```
| append [
    search index=* (sourcetype="azure:monitor:aad" OR sourcetype="mscs:azure:eventhub" OR sourcetype="azure:aad:signin" OR sourcetype="azure:aad:audit" OR sourcetype="ms:aad:signin" OR sourcetype="ms:aad:audit") "MSP Process" ("ServicePrincipalSignInLogs" OR "servicePrincipal") NOT "64.236.54.139"
    ``` 1794045360 = 2026-11-07 09:56 UTC ```
    | where _time >= 1794045360
    | eval host="-", user=coalesce('properties.servicePrincipalName', servicePrincipalName, 'properties.appDisplayName', appDisplayName, "MSP Process"), src=coalesce('properties.ipAddress', ipAddress, src_ip, src), dest=coalesce('properties.resourceDisplayName', resourceDisplayName, "-"), detail="service principal sign-in, result ".coalesce('properties.status.errorCode', 'status.errorCode', "-")
    | fillnull value="-" host user src dest detail
    | stats count min(_time) AS first_seen max(_time) AS last_seen BY host user src dest detail
    | eval data_model="Entra sign-in logs"
    | eval ioc="App sign-ins from outside the MSP Process address", ioc_type="behaviour (alert)"
]

``` Behaviour 4 (Alert): Tenant changes made by the MSP Process app
    Look for: New app credentials, app role assignments, new users or GDAP security-group membership changes initiated by the MSP Process app since 6 November 2026
    Log source: Entra audit logs
    Lead, not proof: compare any hit with your own baseline before acting. ```
| append [
    search index=* (sourcetype="azure:monitor:aad" OR sourcetype="mscs:azure:eventhub" OR sourcetype="azure:aad:signin" OR sourcetype="azure:aad:audit" OR sourcetype="ms:aad:signin" OR sourcetype="ms:aad:audit") "MSP Process" ("credentials" OR "Certificates and secrets" OR "app role assignment" OR "Add member to group" OR "Add user")
    | where _time >= 1793923200
    | eval host="-", user=coalesce('properties.initiatedBy.app.displayName', "MSP Process"), src="-", dest=coalesce('properties.operationName', operationName, activityDisplayName, "-"), detail="Entra audit change initiated by MSP Process"
    | fillnull value="-" host user src dest detail
    | stats count min(_time) AS first_seen max(_time) AS last_seen BY host user src dest detail
    | eval data_model="Entra audit logs"
    | eval ioc="Tenant changes made by the MSP Process app", ioc_type="behaviour (alert)"
]
| sort 0 - last_seen
| eval first_seen=strftime(first_seen, "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S"), last_seen=strftime(last_seen, "%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S")
| table first_seen last_seen ioc ioc_type data_model host user src dest detail count

``` Behaviours to check by hand (no reliable Splunk field mapping, so no search is written):

    Behaviour 2 (Hunt): One address trying several partner app secrets
        Look for: One address using several partner app secrets within seconds, first failing (invalid client secret, missing service principal) and succeeding about an hour later
        Log source: Entra service principal sign-in logs
        Why no search: needs the partner's list of app secrets and failure codes per tenant; group your Entra service principal sign-ins by IP address and count distinct apps

    Behaviour 3 (Alert): Admin refresh token used from another address
        Look for: Non-interactive user sign-ins with the connecting admin's refresh token from an address other than 64.236.54.139
        Log source: Entra non-interactive user sign-in logs
        Why no search: depends on which admin account connected the app in your tenant; filter non-interactive sign-ins for that account not from 64.236.54.139

    Behaviour 5 (Hunt): Graph requests with the app's tokens from another address
        Look for: Microsoft Graph requests made with the app's tokens from an address other than 64.236.54.139
        Log source: Microsoft Graph activity logs (only if already enabled on 7 November)
        Why no search: Microsoft Graph activity logs are only available if they were enabled before 7 November; filter them for the app ID and IP addresses other than 64.236.54.139

    Behaviours are leads, not confirmed indicators, and can match legitimate activity. Compare any hit against your own baseline and environment before acting. Behaviours are for hunting and alerting only; never block on them. ```
